Welcome to the [JSON2Video tutorial](https://json2video.com/docs/tutorial/)!
In this tutorial, you will learn how to use JSON2Video going through all the features, explanations and simple examples.
Although it's not required, it's recommended to follow the suggested order.
First thing you need is a JSON2Video user account and an API key:
[Get your free API Key](https://json2video.com/get-api-key/)

## What you will learn?

You should start reading the [Getting started](https://json2video.com/docs/tutorial/getting-started/) section. There you will learn the basics of JSON2Video:
- How to authenticate your calls to the API
- What is a movie and its structure
- What are the scenes and elements
- How to position elements in the video
- How the different elements overlay
- How to use the cache to optimise the video rendering
After getting started, you can go through all the types of elements JSON2Video offers to create your videos.
